<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Installation<sp/>{#installation}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">NDXL<sp/>can<sp/>be<sp/>obtained<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>library&apos;s<sp/>&lt;b&gt;[GitHub<sp/>repository](https://github.com/NonlinearC/NDXL/tree/main/NDXL)&lt;/b&gt;.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>`C/C++`<sp/>header<sp/>files<sp/>are<sp/>located<sp/>inside<sp/>the<sp/>`include`<sp/>folder,<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>precompiled<sp/>libraries<sp/>are<sp/>located<sp/>inside<sp/>the<sp/>`lib`<sp/>folder.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Copy<sp/>these<sp/>folders<sp/>directly<sp/>into<sp/>the<sp/>working<sp/>directory<sp/>of<sp/>your<sp/>project,<sp/>which<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>assume<sp/>has<sp/>the<sp/>following<sp/>structure:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">@dot</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">digraph<sp/>FileStructure<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>rankdir=LR;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>ordering=&quot;out&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>node<sp/>[shape=folder,<sp/>style=filled,<sp/>fillcolor=&quot;#eef4fa&quot;,<sp/>fontname=&quot;Helvetica&quot;];</highlight></codeline>
